==Battleground==
*10 [[Gato Amigo (Enemy)|Gato Amigos]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 0.67~3.33 seconds<sup>20f~100f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gato Amigo (Enemy)|Gato Amigos]] spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Skelecat (Enemy)|Skelecats]] (100%) spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[Hyper Mr. (Enemy)|Hyper Mr.]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Dark Lazer (Enemy)|Dark Lazer]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Skelecat (Enemy)|Skelecat]] (20%) spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Flying Ninja Cat (Enemy)|Flying Ninja Cat]] spawns.
**1 [[Lollycat (Enemy)|Lollycat]] spawns.
**1 [[Lollycat (Enemy)|Lollycat]] spawns.
**1 [[Lollycat (Enemy)|Lollycat]] spawns.
**1 [[Loincloth Cat (Enemy)|Loincloth Cat]] spawns.
**10 [[Riceball Cat (Enemy)|Riceball Cats]] spawn, delay 0.67~1.33 seconds<sup>20f~40f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cat]] can handle the peons in the beginning with several Meatshields, and even Hyper Mr. won't be too much of an issue. Build up money for a bit, then prepare [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]] for when the boss spawns. [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Sadako Cat]] can tank Flying Ninja, and [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Sexy Legs Cat]] can snipe both Loincloth and Lollycat. Aside from this, bring high range attackers and more Meatshields.

